
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Duranian Military.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Duranian Military.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"gi0s4u","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777149406796,"size":2459,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"gi0s4u"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,25],"#Culture - Duranian Military":[27,28],"#The \"Elite Quality\" military doctrine of the Duranian Royal Army.":[29,37],"#The \"Elite Quality\" military doctrine of the Duranian Royal Army.#{1}":[30,37]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["duranian military","duranian army","duranian archers","duranian steel"],"refine_keys":["duran","duranian","army","soldier","military","war"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Duranian Military (Culture)**\n\n**What:** The \"Elite Quality\" doctrine of the Duranian Royal Army; a philosophy of producing small, highly skilled armies born from steel scarcity.\n\n**When selected:** Scenes featuring Duranian soldiers, archers, armor/weapons, military strategy, or discussing Duran's martial culture. Also relevant to Duranian characters demonstrating exceptional skill or disciplined morale (e.g., Estra's crossbow proficiency).\n\n**Key relationships:** Doctrine prioritizes elite soldiers over mass armies; morale is a force multiplier. Armor uses brass/leather to protect scarce steel, worn only before battle. Steel-tipped arrows are valuable, so archers (Duranian Longbowmen) are legendary for accuracy and discipline, turning battles. Estra's skill reflects this cultural investment."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Duranian Military.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"d2swxq","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - Duranian Military.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,25],"size":1096,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
